port Text	Descriptive Text\r\nDescribes something in general	Describes a specific thing\r\nGives factual and scientific information	Gives detailed description of one object\r\nUses general participants	Uses specific participants\r\nObjective	Can be subjective\r\nExample: “Cats are mammals.”	Example: “My cat is very cute.”\r\nExample:\r\nReport Text:\r\n“Elephants are large mammals that live in Africa and Asia.”\r\nDescriptive Text:\r\n“My elephant at the zoo has big ears and long tusks.”'),(32053,'673',42,'PAT_9370','uraian','Write a short recount text about your unforgettable experience (minimum 8 sentences)!','','','','','','','Contoh Jawaban Recount Text:\r\n\r\nLast holiday, I went to my grandmother’s house. I went there with my family by car. We arrived in the afternoon. My grandmother cooked delicious food for us. The next day, we visited a beautiful beach near her house. We took many pictures there. I felt very happy during the holiday. Finally, we returned home on Sunday.'),(32054,'673',43,'PAT_9370','uraian','Arrange the following words into a good sentence!<div><br></div><div>“yesterday – cleaned – the students – classroom – the”</div>','','','','','','','“The students cleaned the classroom yesterday.”'),(32055,'673',44,'PAT_9370','uraian','Arrange the following sentences into a good procedure text!<div><br></div><div>Pour hot water into the cup.</div><div>Prepare a cup and a tea bag.</div><div>Serve the tea.</div><div>Put the tea bag into the cup.</div>','','','','','','','2 → 4 → 1 → 3'),(32056,'673',45,'PAT_9370','uraian','What is the difference between narrative text and recount text? Explain briefly!','','','','','','','Narrative Text bertujuan menghibur pembaca dan biasanya berisi cerita khayal atau legenda.\r\nRecount Text bertujuan menceritakan kembali pengalaman atau kejadian nyata di masa lalu.'),(32057,'672',1,'PAT_9369','pg','<b>Read the text carefully!</b><div><br></div><div>Dolphins are intelligent sea mammals. They live in oceans and seas ar